  <text id="background-place-label" x="72" y="218" width="480" height="24" font="caption" size="14" color="muted" wrap="false">THE PLACE</text>
  <text id="background-place-copy" x="72" y="250" width="600" height="78" font="body" size="21" color="ink" line-height="1.3"><p>Balangiga sits on the southern coast of Samar facing Leyte Gulf, with the Balangiga River meeting the coast. The municipality is organized across 13 barangays.</p></text>
